# Walkthrough: TDR Crash Resolution & Build Verification

## Changes Implemented

### 1. Robustness Hardening (TDR Fix)
*   **Reduced Concurrency**: Modified [src/AsyncImageProvider.cpp](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/AsyncImageProvider.cpp) to limit video threads to 1 and RAW threads to 2.
    *   *Why*: Prevents D3D11 Device Context race conditions (0xBBADBEEF).
*   **Frame Budgeting**: Integrated [FrameBudgetScheduler](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/test_scrollbench/src/FrameBudgetScheduler.cpp#5-14) into [src/main.cpp](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/main.cpp) and [src/AsyncImageProvider.cpp](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/AsyncImageProvider.cpp).
    *   *Why*: Throttles image delivery to the UI thread (max 4 per frame) to prevent event loop flooding.

### 2. Build System Repairs
*   **Compilation Fixes**: Corrected syntax errors in [src/main.cpp](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/main.cpp) (missing main signature) and access control in [src/AsyncImageProvider.h](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/AsyncImageProvider.h) (friend class).
*   **Linker Fixes**: Updated [CMakeLists.txt](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/CMakeLists.txt) to link [FrameBudgetScheduler](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/test_scrollbench/src/FrameBudgetScheduler.cpp#5-14) to `tst_imagemodel`.

### 3. Documentation
*   **Build Guide**: Updated [docs/BUILD.md](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/docs/BUILD.md) to include Single Exe and Static Setup instructions.
*   **Scope**: Updated [docs/AI_DEVELOPMENT_SCOPE.md](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/docs/AI_DEVELOPMENT_SCOPE.md) with new capabilities.

